--   ```
--
--   **Context.** KFC: the self-contained fine-cost forward field move `fwdF`
--
--   `fwdF_spec`: on `t` with `ints xs ++ R` on stack `0` and `P, q, M, B` on stacks `1 … 4`,
--   `fwdF` ends in `t.upd 0 (ints (pull [P,q,M,B] [P,M,q,B] gS 0 xs) ++ R)` (all scratch stacks
--   restored) with cost `≤ cFwdF P q M B w = (2q+16)·kap w·V + cUL P + cUL q + cUL M + cUL B + 1000`,
--   `V = P·q·M·B`, `w` a bound on the bit size of the entries of `xs` only.
